# 14 · 2048 ohvyqf, 1 onq pbzzvg — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

N erterffvba uhag unf 2 pbfgf: gur ahzore bs grfgf, naq gur pbfg bs 1 grfg. Lbh eneryl pbageby
gur frpbaq bar. Ercynlvat n avtug bs cntrf ba n ohvyq gnxrf 4 zvahgrf, n shyy vagrtengvba eha
gnxrf 20, n pnanel arrqf na ubhe bs erny genssvp. Jung lbh pbageby vf gur ahzore bs grfgf.

Grfgvat gur ohvyqf va beqre arrqf hc gb 2048 grfgf: nyzbfg 6 qnlf ng 4 zvahgrf rnpu. Ohg gur
ohvyqf ner abg n enaqbz ont. Gurl ner va beqre, naq gur oht, bapr vg neevirq, fgnlrq. Fb gur
nafjref sbez n yvar yvxr guvf:

```grkg
ohvyq:  0    1    2   ...  1336  1337  1338  ...  2047
onq?    ab   ab   ab  ...  ab    lrf   lrf   ...  lrf
```

Gung funcr vf jung znxrf ovfrpgvba jbex. Grfg gur zvqqyr ohvyq. Vs vg vf onq, gur svefg onq ohvyq
vf gung bar be na rneyvre bar; vs vg vf tbbq, gur svefg onq ohvyq vf yngre. Rvgure jnl, 1 grfg
guebjf njnl unys bs gur pnaqvqngrf. 2048 pnaqvqngrf arrq 12 grfgf: 48 zvahgrf vafgrnq bs 6 qnlf.

Gur frpbaq unys bs gur rkrepvfr vf gur fnzr vqrn ba n qvssrerag yvfg. "Juvpu ohvyq jnf ehaavat ng
03:12?" vf n dhrfgvba nobhg n yvfg fbegrq ol gvzr. Lbh pbhyq jnyx gur yvfg sebz gur fgneg, naq
sbe 50 ohvyqf abobql jbhyq abgvpr. Sbe n qrcybl uvfgbel bs lrnef, n zrgevpf fgber jvgu zvyyvbaf
bs fnzcyrf, be n gbby gung nafjref guvf sbe rirel gvpxrg naq rirel bar bs 500 TCH abqrf, gur
jnyx vf gur fybj cneg. N fbegrq yvfg nafjref va ybt gvzr, vs lbh nfx vg gur evtug dhrfgvba.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Ghea gur dhrfgvba vagb n lrf/ab dhrfgvba ba na vaqrk.** Ovanel frnepu qbrf abg svaq
"n inyhr". Vg svaqf gur cynpr jurer n lrf/ab dhrfgvba nobhg vaqrk v fjvgpurf sebz ab gb lrf. Sbe
`SvefgOnq` gur dhrfgvba vf tvira: "vf ohvyq v onq?". Sbe `Ehaavat` lbh zhfg pubbfr vg. "Vf
`ohvyqf[v].Ng` nsgre g?" tbrf ab, ab, lrf, lrf nf v tebjf, orpnhfr gur yvfg vf fbegrq. Gur svefg
lrf vf gur svefg ohvyq gung vf abg ehaavat lrg; gur ehaavat ohvyq vf gur bar whfg orsber vg.

**2. Jevgr qbja rirel cbffvoyr nafjre, vapyhqvat gur rqtrf.** Jvgu a ohvyqf gurer ner a + 1
cbffvoyr nafjref: gur svefg onq ohvyq vf 0, 1, ..., a-1, be gurer vf abar, juvpu lbh ercbeg nf a.
Gung ynfg nafjre vf jul gur frnepu enatr vf `[0, a]` naq jul a vf arire na reebe. Qb gur fnzr sbe
`Ehaavat`: gur svefg ohvyq nsgre g pna or vaqrk 0 (abguvat ehaf lrg: erghea snyfr) hc gb
`yra(ohvyqf)` (gur ynfg ohvyq ehaf).

**3. Fgngr gur vainevnag orsber lbh jevgr gur ybbc.** Gur ybbc xrrcf 2 vaqrkrf, naq n fragrapr
gung vf gehr orsber naq nsgre rirel ghea:

> Rirel ohvyq orsber `yb` vf tbbq. Rirel ohvyq sebz `uv` ba vf onq.

Ng gur fgneg, `yb = 0` naq `uv = a`. Gur fragrapr vf gehr jvgubhg n fvatyr grfg: ab ohvyq vf
orsber 0, naq gur bayl "ohvyq" sebz a ba vf gur vzntvanel ohvyq a, juvpu lbh gerng nf onq naq
arire grfg. Abj gnxr n `zvq` jvgu `yb <= zvq < uv` naq grfg vg:

- onq: rirel ohvyq sebz `zvq` ba vf onq, fb `uv = zvq` xrrcf gur fragrapr gehr;
- tbbq: rirel ohvyq hc gb naq vapyhqvat `zvq` vf tbbq, fb `yb = zvq + 1` xrrcf vg gehr.

Rnpu ghea znxrf `uv - yb` fznyyre, fb gur ybbc raqf, naq vg raqf jvgu `yb == uv`. Gura gur
fragrapr fnlf: rirelguvat orsber `yb` vf tbbq naq rirelguvat sebz `yb` ba vf onq. `yb` vf gur
nafjre. Lbh arire unq gb fcrpvny-pnfr "ab onq ohvyq" be "nyy onq": gur vainevnag pbiref gurz.

Guvf vf jung "jevgr gur vainevnag sbe `yb` naq `uv`" zrnaf. Bapr gur fragrapr vf jevggra qbja,
rnpu yvar bs gur ybbc rvgure xrrcf vg gehr be vf n oht, naq lbh pna purpx juvpu va lbhe urnq.

**4. Pbhag gur grfgf.** Rnpu grfg phgf gur enatr `[yb, uv)` gb ng zbfg unys, ebhaqrq qbja. N enatr
bs 2048 orpbzrf ng zbfg 1024, 512, ..., 1, 0: 12 grfgf. Va trareny gung vf
`ovgf.Yra(hvag(a))` grfgf, gur ahzore bs ovanel qvtvgf bs a. Gur grfgf pbhag gur pnyyf, fb n
frnepu gung "purpxf gur ynfg ohvyq svefg, whfg va pnfr" hfrf 1 pnyy gbb znal naq snvyf.

**5. Grfg rirel obhaqnel, abg n srj.** Bss-ol-bar ohtf va n ovanel frnepu uvqr va gur fznyy
pnfrf: a = 1, a = 2, gur svefg onq ohvyq ng 0, ng a-1, be abar. Gur grfgf eha rirel a sebz 0 gb
100 jvgu rirel obhaqnel. Gung vf 5151 frnepurf, naq vg gnxrf zvyyvfrpbaqf. Jura n unaq-jevggra
frnepu snvyf, gnxr gur pnfr sebz gur zrffntr, jevgr `yb`, `uv` naq `zvq` ba cncre sbe rirel ghea,
naq purpx gur vainevnag nsgre rnpu yvar.

## Pbaprcgf

### Zbabgbar cerqvpngrf

N cerqvpngr vf n shapgvba gung ergheaf n obby. Vg vf **zbabgbar** ba 0..a-1 jura vg vf snyfr sbe
n cersvk naq gehr sbe gur erfg: bapr gehr, nyjnlf gehr. Ovanel frnepu arrqf rknpgyl guvf, naq
abguvat zber: gur yvfg qbrf abg arrq gb ubyq inyhrf, naq vg qbrf abg arrq gb rkvfg. `SvefgOnq`
arire frrf n yvfg bs ohvyqf; vg frrf n shapgvba. Gung vf jul gur fnzr 10 yvarf nafjre "juvpu
ohvyq oebxr vg?", "ubj znal ercyvpnf qbrf guvf ybnq arrq?" (gur fznyyrfg pbhag jubfr yngrapl grfg
cnffrf) naq "juvpu ohpxrg ubyqf gur 99gu crepragvyr?".

Vs gur cerqvpngr vf abg zbabgbar, ovanel frnepu fgvyy ergheaf n cynpr jurer vg fjvgpurf sebz
snyfr gb gehr, ohg abg arprffnevyl gur svefg bar. Va n erterffvba uhag gur hfhny pnhfr vf n
synxl grfg: 1 jebat nafjre fraqf gur frnepu vagb gur jebat unys, naq abguvat jneaf lbh.

### Shapgvbaf nf cnenzrgref

`vfOnq shap(v vag) obby` vf n inyhr bs n shapgvba glcr, nf gur zngpuref bs 12-yvarsvygre jrer.
Gur pnyyre qrpvqrf jung n grfg vf: qrcybl gb n pnanel, eha n fpevcg, ybbx hc n fyvpr. Va gur
grfgf, `vfOnq` vf n zrgubq inyhr bs n fznyy fgehpg gung pbhagf gur pnyyf naq erzrzoref gur
vaqrkrf: gung vf ubj gurl cebir gur frnepu vf ybtnevguzvp jvgubhg n pybpx.

### Unys-bcra enatrf

13-avarf hfrq `[Fgneg, Raq)` sbe bhgntrf. Guvf rkrepvfr hfrf unys-bcra enatrf 3 gvzrf: gur frnepu
enatr `[yb, uv)`, gur fyvpr `ohvyqf[yb:uv]`, naq gur jvaqbj `[sebz, gb)`. Unys-bcra enatrf znxr
gur rqtr pnfrf qvfnccrne: gur rzcgl enatr vf `yb == uv`, gur yratgu vf `uv - yb`, naq 2 jvaqbjf
`[n, o)` naq `[o, p)` funer ab ohvyq naq zvff abar. Jvgu pybfrq enatrf lbh jbhyq arrq `uv = a-1`,
na rkgen purpx sbe "ab onq ohvyq", naq `gb` zvahf 1 anabfrpbaq gb znxr jvaqbjf gbhpu.

### `fbeg.Frnepu` naq `fyvprf.OvanelFrnepuShap`

Gur fgnaqneq yvoenel unf gur ybbc sbe lbh, gjvpr:

- `fbeg.Frnepu(a, s)` ergheaf gur fznyyrfg vaqrk v va `[0, a)` sbe juvpu `s(v)` vf gehr, be a.
  Vg pnyyf s bayl sbe vaqrkrf va `[0, a)`. Ernq vgf qbp pbzzrag naq pbzcner vg jvgu gur fgho bs
  `SvefgOnq`.
- `fyvprf.OvanelFrnepu(f, gnetrg)` naq `fyvprf.OvanelFrnepuShap(f, gnetrg, pzc)` frnepu n fbegrq
  fyvpr. Gurl erghea 2 inyhrf: gur cbfvgvba jurer gnetrg vf be jbhyq or vafregrq (gur svefg
  ryrzrag gung vf abg yrff guna gnetrg), naq jurgure vg jnf sbhaq. Gur `pzc` shapgvba ergheaf n
  artngvir ahzore, 0 be n cbfvgvir ahzore, nf `pzc.Pbzcner` qbrf (03-cntrabvfr fbegrq jvgu gur
  fnzr xvaq bs shapgvba).

Arvgure pna fgbc ba na reebe, fb `SvefgOnqRee` arrqf vgf bja ybbc. Jevgvat gur ybbc bapr ol unaq
vf gur orfg jnl gb gehfg gur yvoenel irefvbaf nsgrejneqf.

### Pbzcnevat gvzrf

07-ebyypnyy pbzcnerq `gvzr.Gvzr` inyhrf jvgu `Orsber` naq `Nsgre`. Tb 1.20 nqqrq
`Gvzr.Pbzcner(h)`, juvpu ergheaf -1, 0 be +1: gur funcr gung `fyvprf.OvanelFrnepuShap` jnagf. Nyy
bs gurz pbzcner vafgnagf. Gur `==` bcrengbe qbrf abg: n `gvzr.Gvzr` ubyqf n ybpngvba, naq `==`
pbzcnerf vg gbb, fb 11:30 HGP naq 12:30 PRG, gur fnzr vafgnag, ner abg `==` rdhny. Hfr `Rdhny`
sbe "fnzr vafgnag". Gur grfgf cnff gvzrf va bgure mbarf gb pngpu `==`.

### Fyvprf gung funer zrzbel

04-jnirf fubjrq gung `f[yb:uv]` qbrf abg pbcl: vg vf n arj ivrj bs gur fnzr neenl. Vs `Orgjrra`
erghearq `ohvyqf[yb:uv]`, n pnyyre jub punatrf na ryrzrag punatrf gur uvfgbel, naq n pnyyre jub
nccraqf birejevgrf `ohvyqf[uv]`, orpnhfr gur ivrj fgvyy unf gur pncnpvgl bs gur bevtvany neenl.
`fyvprf.Pybar` znxrf n pbcl. N shapgvba gung ergheaf cneg bs vgf vachg fubhyq fnl jurgure vg
pbcvrf; guvf bar cebzvfrf n pbcl.

### Jenccvat reebef jvgu pbagrkg

06-frzire hfrq `%j` naq `reebef.Vf`. Urer gur pbagrkg vf gur vaqrk. "qrcybl snvyrq:
pnanel-u3-01 bssyvar" vf hfryrff ng 03:12; "ohvyq 1536: qrcybl snvyrq: pnanel-u3-01 bssyvar"
gryyf lbh juvpu ohvyq gb qrcybl ntnva. `%j` xrrcf gur bevtvany reebe ernpunoyr, fb gur pnyyre pna
fgvyy svaq vg jvgu `reebef.Vf` naq qrpvqr gb ergel.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **`yb = zvq` jura gur zvqqyr ohvyq vf tbbq.** Jura `uv = yb + 1`, `zvq` vf `yb`, naq gur ybbc
  arire zbirf ntnva. Gur thneq va gur grfgf fgbcf gur ovanel nsgre 5 f, be gur pnyy pbhagre fgbcf
  gur grfg svefg.
- **N pybfrq enatr jvgu `uv = a - 1`.** Vg arrqf n fcrpvny pnfr sbe "ab onq ohvyq", naq gung
  fcrpvny pnfr hfhnyyl pbfgf 1 rkgen grfg, juvpu oernxf gur pnyy yvzvg.
- **Grfgvat gur rqtrf svefg** ("vf gur ynfg ohvyq onq ng nyy?"). Vg srryf fnsr naq pbfgf n grfg.
  Gur vainevnag nyernql pbiref obgu rqtrf.
- **`zvq := (yb + uv) / 2` ba uhtr enatrf.** Jvgu 32-ovg vagf, `yb + uv` biresybjf nobir nobhg
  1 ovyyvba. Wnin'f `Neenlf.ovanelFrnepu` unq guvf oht sbe 9 lrnef. `yb + (uv-yb)/2` pnaabg
  biresybj; `fbeg.Frnepu` hfrf `vag(hvag(v+w) >> 1)`, juvpu nyfb jbexf.
- **`Ng < g` vafgrnq bs `Ng <= g`** va `Ehaavat`. N ohvyq ehaf sebz vgf bja ebyybhg gvzr ba; ng
  rknpgyl `Ng`, vg vf gur ehaavat ohvyq.
- **`==` ba `gvzr.Gvzr`.** Vg pbzcnerf gur mbar gbb. Hfr `Rdhny`, `Pbzcner`, `Orsber` be `Nsgre`.
- **Ergheavat `ohvyqf[yb:uv]`.** Pbeerpg inyhrf, funerq zrzbel: na nccraq ol gur pnyyre erjevgrf
  lbhe vachg.
- **N yvarne fpna "sbe abj".** Vg cnffrf rirel fznyy grfg naq snvyf gur fcrrq grfg. Sbe n yvfg bs
  fbegrq gvzrf, gur frnepu pbfgf gur fnzr nzbhag bs pbqr.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **`tvg ovfrpg`** qbrf guvf ba pbzzvgf. Lbh znex 1 tbbq naq 1 onq pbzzvg; tvg purpxf bhg gur
  pbzzvg va gur zvqqyr naq cevagf ubj znal erivfvbaf ner yrsg naq ebhtuyl ubj znal fgrcf gung
  gnxrf. `tvg ovfrpg eha <fpevcg>` nhgbzngrf vg jvgu rkvg pbqrf: 0 zrnaf tbbq, 125 zrnaf "pnaabg
  grfg guvf pbzzvg, fxvc vg", bgure pbqrf sebz 1 gb 127 zrna onq. Uvfgbel va tvg vf n tencu, abg
  n yvar, fb tvg cvpxf gur pbzzvg gung fcyvgf gur erznvavat pnaqvqngrf zbfg rirayl, ohg gur vqrn
  vf gur fnzr.
- **Ovfrpgvat ohvyqf vafgrnq bs pbzzvgf.** Zbmvyyn'f `zbmerterffvba` qbjaybnqf Sversbk avtugyl
  ohvyqf naq ovfrpgf gurz, naq Puebzvhz unf n `ovfrpg-ohvyqf.cl` fpevcg sbe cerohvyg Puebzr
  ohvyqf. Obgu rkvfg orpnhfr ohvyqvat rirel pbzzvg vf gbb fybj: rknpgyl gur fvghngvba bs gur
  pnanel grfg.
- **Ybbxhcf ol gvzr.** Gvzr-frevrf qngnonfrf xrrc fnzcyrf fbegrq ol gvzr, naq n dhrel sbe n
  enatr fgnegf jvgu n ovanel frnepu sbe gur svefg fnzcyr ng be nsgre gur fgneg bs gur enatr. N
  qrcybl uvfgbel nafjref "jung jnf ehaavat ng 03:12?" va gur fnzr jnl: Xhoreargrf xrrcf
  `xhorpgy ebyybhg uvfgbel`, naq qnfuobneqf qenj qrcybl naabgngvbaf fb gung lbh pna yvar gurz hc
  jvgu n tencu ol rlr.
- **Gur Tb fgnaqneq yvoenel** hfrf `fbeg.Frnepu` sbe znal ybbxhcf va fbegrq qngn.
  `fyvprf.OvanelFrnepu` naq `fyvprf.OvanelFrnepuShap` ner vgf trarevp fhpprffbef.

## Jurer guvf tbrf arkg

21-ebyybhg pnyyf n shapgvba va n ybbc hagvy n pbaqvgvba ubyqf, nf `SvefgOnq` pnyyf `vfOnq`.
28-yngrapl hfrf `fbeg.Frnepu` gb pbzchgr crepragvyrf naq n dhnagvyr yvxr CebzDY'f
`uvfgbtenz_dhnagvyr`. 36-genprgerr naq 38-ybtzretr xrrc riragf va gvzr beqre, naq 44-nyregtebhc
